4,"surface":"哀","kind":"person","person_id":"emb_vx4_gm9","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-032-chu-suanzi:line050","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-032-chu-suanzi"},{"id":"c-jinshu-032-he-empress:line055:m0004","start":4,"end":6,"surface":"哀帝","kind":"person","person_id":"emb_vx4_gm9","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"穆帝后傳的繼位敘事，與同卷褚后傳哀帝、海西公之世相應，辨為晉哀帝；不新增同稱人物。","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-032-he-empress:line055","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-032-he-empress"},{"id":"c-songshu-001-parents-reference:p002:m0011","start":11,"end":14,"surface":"晉哀帝","kind":"person","person_id":"emb_vx4_gm9","identification_status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依完整同一傳記單元、所述身份及敘事主語辨識；非依同名自動合併。","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-001-parents-reference:p002","chapter_id":"c-songshu-001-parents-reference"},{"id":"c-songshu-041-parents:p001:m0043","start":43,"end":46,"surface":"晉哀帝","kind":"person","person_id":"emb_vx4_gm9","identification_status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依完整同一傳記單元、所述身份及敘事主語辨識；非依同名自動合併。","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-041-parents:p001","chapter_id":"c-songshu-041-parents"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[{"id":"d-jin032-he-aidi","person_id":"emb_vx4_gm9","surfaces":["哀帝"],"scope":"cross_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-jinshu-032-he-empress","c-jinshu-032-chu-suanzi"],"status":"contextual_provisional","confidence_level":"high","identification_basis":{"kind":"source_context","target_mention_ids":["c-jinshu-032-he-empress:line055:m0004"]},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-032","source_id":"s-jinshu-032-he-empress","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-032-he-empress","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-032-he-empress:line055","quote":"后無子。哀帝即位，稱穆皇后，居永安宮。桓玄篡位，移后入司徒府。路經太廟，后停輿慟哭，哀感路人。玄聞而怒曰：「天下禪代常理，何預何氏女子事耶！」乃降后為零陵縣君。與安帝俱西，至巴陵。及劉裕建義，殷仲文奉后還京都，下令曰：「戎車屢警，黎元阻饑。而膳御豐靡，豈與百姓同其儉約。減損供給，勿令游過。」后時以遠還，欲奉拜陵廟。有司以寇難未平，奏停。元興三年崩，年六十六，在位凡四十八年。"},{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-032","source_id":"s-jinshu-032-chu-suanzi","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-032-chu-suanzi","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-032-chu-suanzi:line046","quote":"及哀帝、海西公之世，太后復臨朝稱制。桓溫之廢海西公也，太后方在佛屋燒香，內侍啟云「外有急奏」，太后乃出。尚倚戶前視奏數行，乃曰「我本自疑此」，至半便止，索筆答奏云：「未亡人罹此百憂，感念存沒，心焉如割。」溫始呈詔草，慮太后意異，悚動流汗，見于顏色。及詔出，溫大喜。"}],"rationale":"穆章何后為穆帝后，其後哀帝即位而稱穆皇后；同卷褚后傳依次敘哀帝、海西公之世。兩處處於同一晉室承繼脈絡，連到已登記的晉哀帝。保留稱謂原字，不由此補授職或生卒年。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null},{"id":"d-song041-context-emb_vx4_gm9","person_id":"emb_vx4_gm9","surfaces":["晉哀帝"],"scope":"cross_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-songshu-001-parents-reference","c-songshu-041-parents"],"status":"contextual_provisional","confidence_level":"medium","identification_basis":{"kind":"source_context"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-songshu","book_id":"b-songshu-001","source_id":"s-songshu-001-parents-reference","chapter_id":"c-songshu-001-parents-reference","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-001-parents-reference:p002","quote":"郡功曹翹是為皇考髙祖以晉哀帝興寜元年嵗次癸亥三月壬寅夜生"},{"work_id":"w-songshu","book_id":"b-songshu-041","source_id":"s-songshu-041-parents","chapter_id":"c-songshu-041-parents","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-041-parents:p001","quote":"孝穆趙皇后諱安下邳僮人也祖彪字世範治書侍御史父裔字彦胄平原太守后以晉穆帝升平四年嬪孝皇晉哀帝興寧元年四月二日生高祖其日后以産疾殂於丹徒官舍時年二十一葬晉陵丹徒縣東鄉練璧里雩山宋初追崇號謚陵曰興寧永初二年有司奏曰大孝之德盛於榮親一人有慶光被萬國是以靈文寵於西京夀張顯於隆漢故平原太守趙裔故洮陽令蕭卓並外屬尊戚不逮休寵臣等仰述聖思逺稽舊章並可追贈光祿大夫加金章紫綬裔命婦孫可豫章郡建昌縣君卓命婦趙可吳郡夀昌縣君孫氏東莞人也其年又詔曰推恩之禮在情所同故内樹宗子外崇后屬爰自漢魏咸遵斯典外祖趙光祿蕭光祿名噐雖隆茅土未建並宜追封開國縣侯食邑五百戸於是追封裔臨賀縣侯裔長子宣之仕至江乘令蚤卒無子以弟孫襲之繼宣之紹封襲之卒子祖憐嗣齊受禪國除宣之弟倫之自有傳"}],"rationale":"完整兩后傳敘事與紀年、具名親稱辨識；新人物為來源局部身份，不以同名連他人。夀張外祖追榮典故採樊重，樊宏同爵反證另有固定後漢閱讀reference。","human_reviewed":false,"reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-jinshu-032-chu-suanzi:line046","text":"及哀帝、海西公之世，太后復臨朝稱制。桓溫之廢海西公也，太后方在佛屋燒香，內侍啟云「外有急奏」，太后乃出。尚倚戶前視奏數行，乃曰「我本自疑此」，至半便止，索筆答奏云：「未亡人罹此百憂，感念存沒，心焉如割。」溫始呈詔草，慮太后意異，悚動流汗，見于顏色。及詔出，溫大喜。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"in_progress","mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-032-chu-suanzi:line046:m0001","start":1,"end":3,"surface":"哀帝","kind":"person","person_id":"emb_vx4_gm9","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-032-chu-suanzi:line046:m0004","start":4,"end":7,"surface":"海西公","kind":"person","person_id":"07f_24w_7uz","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-032-chu-suanzi:line046:m0010","start":10,"end":12,"surface":"太后","kind":"person","person_id":"xke_dj3_6ba_AAB","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-032-chu-suanzi:line046:m0018","start":18,"end":20,"surface":"桓溫","kind":"person","person_id":"8uq_4jd_30f","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-032-chu-suanzi:line046:m0022","start":22,"end":25,"surface":"海西公","kind":"person","person_id":"07f_24w_7uz","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-032-chu-suanzi:line046:m0027","start":27,"end":29,"surface":"太后","kind":"person","person_id":"xke_dj3_6ba_AAB","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-032-chu-suanzi:line046:m0047","start":47,"end":49,"surface":"太后","kind":"person","person_id":"xke_dj3_6ba_AAB","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-032-chu-suanzi:line046:m0083","start":83,"end":86,"surface":"未亡人","kind":"person","person_id":"xke_dj3_6ba_AAB","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-032-chu-suanzi:line046:m0102","start":102,"end":103,"surface":"溫","kind":"person","person_id":"8uq_4jd_30f","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-032-chu-suanzi:line046:m0109","start":109,"end":111,"surface":"太后","kind":"person","person_id":"xke_dj3_6ba_AAB","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-032-chu-suanzi:line046:m0128","start":128,"end":129,"surface":"溫","kind":"person","person_id":"8uq_4jd_30f","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"source_position":{"first_line":46,"last_line":46,"revision_id":1543614,"editorial_excerpt_boundary":false},"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-032-chu-suanzi","book_id":"b-jinshu-032","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-032-chu-suanzi"},{"id":"c-jinshu-032-chu-suanzi:line050","text":"太元九年，崩于顯陽殿，年六十一，在位凡四十年。太后於帝為從嫂，朝議疑其服。太學博士徐藻議曰：「資父事君而敬同。又禮云『其夫屬父道者，妻皆母道也』，則夫屬君道，妻亦后道矣。服后以齊，母之義也。魯譏逆祀，以明尊卑。今上躬奉康、穆、哀皇及靖后之祀，致敬同于所天，豈可敬之以君道，而服廢於本親。謂應齊衰期。」從之。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"in_progress","mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-032-chu-suanzi:line050:m0023","start":23,"end":25,"surface":"太后","kind":"person","person_id":"xke_dj3_6ba_AAB","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-032-chu-suanzi:line050:m0026","start":26,"end":27,"surface":"帝","kind":"person","person_id":"uke_dff_yrf","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-032-chu-suanzi:line050:m0041","start":41,"end":43,"surface":"徐藻","kind":"person","person_id":"yzr_t9c_k7v","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-032-chu-suanzi:line050:m0105","start":105,"end":107,"surface":"今上","kind":"person","person_id":"uke_dff_yrf","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-032-chu-suanzi:line050:m0109","start":109,"end":110,"surface":"康","kind":"person","person_id":"qpk_4pt_y6r","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-032-chu-suanzi:line050:m0111","start":111,"end":112,"surface":"穆","kind":"person","person_id":"84i_4jp_gmc","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-032-chu-suanzi:line050:m0113","start":113,"end":114,"surface":"哀","kind":"person","person_id":"emb_vx4_gm9","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-032-chu-suanzi:line050:m0116","start":116,"end":118,"surface":"靖后","kind":"person","person_id":"puf_csp_mxf","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"source_position":{"first_line":50,"last_line":50,"revision_id":1543614,"editorial_excerpt_boundary":false},"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-032-chu-suanzi","book_id":"b-jinshu-032","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-032-chu-suanzi"},{"id":"c-jinshu-032-he-empress:line055","text":"后無子。哀帝即位，稱穆皇后，居永安宮。桓玄篡位，移后入司徒府。路經太廟，后停輿慟哭，哀感路人。玄聞而怒曰：「天下禪代常理，何預何氏女子事耶！」乃降后為零陵縣君。與安帝俱西，至巴陵。及劉裕建義，殷仲文奉后還京都，下令曰：「戎車屢警，黎元阻饑。而膳御豐靡，豈與百姓同其儉約。減損供給，勿令游過。」后時以遠還，欲奉拜陵廟。有司以寇難未平，奏停。元興三年崩，年六十六，在位凡四十八年。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"in_progress","mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-032-he-empress:line055:m0000","start":0,"end":1,"surface":"后","kind":"person","person_id":"3ea_uzt_2n2_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-032-he-empress:line055:m0004","start":4,"end":6,"surface":"哀帝","kind":"person","person_id":"emb_vx4_gm9","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"穆帝后傳的繼位敘事，與同卷褚后傳哀帝、海西公之世相應，辨為晉哀帝；不新增同稱人物。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-032-he-empress:line055:m0010","start":10,"end":13,"surface":"穆皇后","kind":"person","person_id":"3ea_uzt_2n2_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-032-he-empress:line055:m0019","start":19,"end":21,"surface":"桓玄","kind":"person","person_id":"lf6_f95_379","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-032-he-empress:line055:m0025","start":25,"end":26,"surface":"后","kind":"person","person_id":"3ea_uzt_2n2_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-032-he-empress:line055:m0036","start":36,"end":37,"surface":"后","kind":"person","person_id":"3ea_uzt_2n2_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-032-he-empress:line055:m0047","start":47,"end":48,"surface":"玄","kind":"person","person_id":"lf6_f95_379","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-032-he-empress:line055:m0063","start":63,"end":67,"surface":"何氏女子","kind":"person","person_id":"3ea_uzt_2n2_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-032-he-empress:line055:m0073","start":73,"end":74,"surface":"后","kind":"person","person_id":"3ea_uzt_2n2_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-032-he-empress:line055:m0081","start":81,"end":83,"surface":"安帝","kind":"person","person_id":"s6y_280_81r","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-032-he-empress:line055:m0091","start":91,"end":93,"surface":"劉裕","kind":"person","person_id":"3dv_ken_w58","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-032-he-empress:line055:m0096","start":96,"end":99,"surface":"殷仲